-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial?p=1224119#post1224119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m quoting this in my sig. You can\u2019t stop me! (Of course, I\u2019ll first need to get home ...)</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn, I better start running in order to not let that happen. <i>Fast</i>.<br /> <br /> EDIT: You know what? I'll let it pass since your Tzeentch comment the other day reminded I still have the Ahriman omnibus to finish and gave me the excuse to start Book 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 06-02-2018, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T10:16:22-07:00","id":1225615,"title":"","content":"I started writing today. Just wanted to say this might take a little because of a couple of reasons.<br /> <br /> The first is that I haven't got much spare time to write right now (though I still want to do it because I enjoy it a lot and it helps me remain sane), but mos