peg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-21T12:22:08-08:00","id":1369422,"title":"","content":"Ok folks, I'm not having the easiest time at writing lately because of various shenanigans, but I feel like the vibes of this subforum could use some improvements*. Things right now remind me of how the general mood was at some past occasions. I'll do my part and try my best to provide some cheer.<br /> <br /> We'll probably start with a Heroes essay and try to keep going. It will take some time, those things are messy and lenghty (and Heroes are a thorny topic, so I need to prepare accordingly), but that's the plan. Which I'm writing here so I will feel bad if I don't keep my own word.<br /> <br /> Let's try to shake off some rust and get the engine moving, shall we?<br /> <br /> *How do I know? I'm <i>always</i> here, lurking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 02-21-2020, 03:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-